WEBVTT

01:32.160 --> 01:34.280
The land of Shu always regards
red silk as precious.

01:34.960 --> 01:37.760
Mr. Ji's Shu Red Silk
is even more renowned.

01:37.840 --> 01:39.360
Ms. Ji, you dyed a lot of silks.

01:39.440 --> 01:41.120
Why aren't any silks dyed red?

01:41.200 --> 01:43.320
I'll dye any color I want.

01:43.400 --> 01:45.560
Mr. Yang, it's none of your concern.

01:47.520 --> 01:48.680
That's the main gate.

01:49.560 --> 01:50.400
Please.

01:51.400 --> 01:54.520
We have quite a number of guests today.

01:58.720 --> 01:59.720
What is she doing here?

01:59.800 --> 02:00.840
I don't know either.

02:01.760 --> 02:04.840
Yingying, come and greet Mrs. Zhao now.

02:08.720 --> 02:09.560
- Good morrow, Mrs. Zhao.
- Good morrow, Mrs. Zhao.

02:11.800 --> 02:14.680
Although your family
is not a noble household,

02:14.760 --> 02:17.080
there's no reason for your daughter
to be running around every day.

02:18.560 --> 02:20.840
It's one thing when she spends
all her time outside.

02:20.920 --> 02:22.920
However, she even brings men to the house.

02:23.760 --> 02:25.280
It's a minor matter

02:25.360 --> 02:27.920
if Ms. Ji's reputation
is tarnished when this spreads,

02:28.000 --> 02:30.520
but what of your family's honor?

02:33.160 --> 02:34.280
You misunderstood me.

02:34.360 --> 02:36.240
He's here to meet Yaoting for business.

02:36.320 --> 02:37.560
I just happened to chance upon him.

02:37.640 --> 02:38.520
Yes.

02:39.880 --> 02:41.680
It's just a friendly reminder.

02:42.280 --> 02:44.520
Pay no mind to me
if you think it is no trouble.

02:45.800 --> 02:49.360
I fear that should something disgraceful
happen one day,

02:50.040 --> 02:53.440
it will be too late for regrets by then.

02:56.240 --> 02:57.600
You're right, Mrs. Zhao.

02:58.240 --> 02:59.920
Even a misunderstanding

03:00.000 --> 03:02.440
could make those who are clueless tattle.

03:03.040 --> 03:05.080
I'll make sure to discipline her
so as to avert

03:05.160 --> 03:06.560
even the smallest mistake.

03:08.840 --> 03:11.680
However, I believe a sharp person like you

03:11.760 --> 03:13.440
would not misunderstand.

03:14.760 --> 03:16.120
Come, Mrs. Zhao. This way.

03:23.200 --> 03:26.000
It turns out that even you
have moments of meekness and grace.

03:27.160 --> 03:29.760
You have visited my home.
I have kept my end of the bargain.

03:29.840 --> 03:32.120
You can get your drink
from another house now.

03:36.520 --> 03:38.800
Mrs. Ji, I will take my leave now.

03:51.920 --> 03:53.040
Ting.

03:59.400 --> 04:00.520
Stop right there!

04:00.600 --> 04:01.480
Mother, I'm wrong.

04:03.640 --> 04:04.640
Mother, stay away!

04:04.720 --> 04:06.280
- Mother!
- Ji Yingying! Get here now.

04:06.360 --> 04:07.680
- Ji Yingying.
- Mother!

04:07.760 --> 04:08.960
- Don't hit me!
- Ji Yingying.

04:09.040 --> 04:09.880
Don't…!

04:10.920 --> 04:11.760
Get here now!

04:12.400 --> 04:13.480
- Mother!
- Who was that man?

04:13.560 --> 04:15.480
Mother…

04:15.560 --> 04:17.279
That was Mr. Yang.

04:17.360 --> 04:19.920
He's doing business with our family.

04:20.000 --> 04:20.920
Business?

04:21.600 --> 04:22.720
Is that true?

04:23.400 --> 04:26.280
Do you think you can fool me
just because I'm no longer in charge?

04:27.000 --> 04:30.000
His clothing alone made it clear
that he is no ordinary folk.

04:30.080 --> 04:31.800
Why would he do business with us?

04:33.480 --> 04:34.920
He came to inquire about Shu Red Silk.

04:35.600 --> 04:36.640
Shu Red Silk?

04:38.240 --> 04:39.640
Shu Red Silk again?

04:40.840 --> 04:41.760
It has been so many years.

04:41.840 --> 04:43.320
These people won't stop.

04:45.800 --> 04:48.040
NOTICE

04:58.080 --> 05:00.480
You're here early.

05:00.560 --> 05:01.640
BROCADE BUREAU

05:01.720 --> 05:03.400
Did Chief Sang truly agree
to post the notice

05:03.480 --> 05:04.760
to stop the monopolization of the creek?

05:05.560 --> 05:07.000
It's all thanks to me.

05:07.840 --> 05:11.160
You should have done it earlier.

05:12.440 --> 05:15.680
Is your father as unreliable as you too?

05:15.760 --> 05:17.200
My father is a dignified

05:18.000 --> 05:20.880
and respected government officer
of the country.

05:21.520 --> 05:22.800
You think he's unreliable?

05:23.400 --> 05:25.480
What did you mean?
Did you just call me unreliable?

05:26.120 --> 05:29.440
Listen. Show some respect
to the honorary president.

05:29.520 --> 05:31.040
Now listen to me.

05:31.120 --> 05:32.400
If you succeed this time,

05:32.480 --> 05:34.880
I'll give you a deep bow every time

05:36.200 --> 05:37.280
I see you.

05:40.360 --> 05:41.760
- Father!
- Chief Sang.

05:41.840 --> 05:43.560
Hurry up and put up the notice.

05:43.640 --> 05:45.200
- They…
- What trouble are you causing?

05:45.280 --> 05:46.480
Go home now!

05:46.560 --> 05:47.600
Chief Sang,

05:48.120 --> 05:50.040
Huanhua Creek is in constant turmoil.

05:50.120 --> 05:51.200
Do you have a solution?

05:52.720 --> 05:56.440
This is no longer under my control.

05:57.800 --> 05:58.880
Not under your control?

05:59.960 --> 06:01.560
Funnily enough,

06:01.640 --> 06:04.200
I'm only temporarily filling the spot
of a brocade officer.

06:04.280 --> 06:07.120
The newly transferred
brocade officer has arrived.

06:07.200 --> 06:08.360
It has been over a month,

06:08.440 --> 06:10.160
and yet, he is nowhere to be seen.

06:10.840 --> 06:13.760
Perhaps he is afraid to come.

06:14.440 --> 06:15.880
All of you know Mr. Shen,

06:15.960 --> 06:19.480
the previous brocade officer who died
two years upon his arrival.

06:19.560 --> 06:23.240
Mr. Zhang, the one before him,
fell off a horse and died.

06:23.320 --> 06:24.640
The previous one…

06:24.720 --> 06:25.960
Chief Sang,

06:27.280 --> 06:29.640
we rely on this to make ends meet.

06:29.720 --> 06:31.080
This is important.

06:31.160 --> 06:33.800
Do you know who is in charge
of this matter now?

06:33.880 --> 06:36.560
- Yes, Father. Get to the point…!
- Hold your tongue!

06:39.000 --> 06:43.560
Yesterday was the deadline for
the new brocade officer to take office.

06:43.640 --> 06:45.160
We all thought he was not coming.

06:45.240 --> 06:48.160
Who would have thought
that the new brocade officer

06:48.240 --> 06:50.440
took office just as the deadline
was about to pass?

06:50.520 --> 06:52.320
Naturally, I stepped down.

06:52.400 --> 06:55.040
From henceforth,
I will continue my duties,

06:55.120 --> 06:56.800
while the brocade officer
will continue his.

06:56.880 --> 06:59.280
You will have to look for him
for this matter.

06:59.360 --> 07:02.560
Why did he have to take office yesterday?

07:02.640 --> 07:03.920
- Exactly.
- That's right.

07:04.600 --> 07:07.760
What is the new brocade officer like?

07:07.840 --> 07:09.520
You will know when you meet him.

07:10.640 --> 07:11.560
A new brocade officer?

07:11.640 --> 07:12.880
Let me see who he is!

07:13.480 --> 07:15.280
- Let me see who he is!
- Take him away!

07:15.360 --> 07:17.040
Open the door! Come out! Let me see you!

07:18.040 --> 07:19.480
- Hold your tongue!
- Stop him!

07:19.560 --> 07:20.520
Don't worry, I got this.

07:22.000 --> 07:22.920
Enough…

07:24.400 --> 07:25.640
Chief Sang,

07:27.280 --> 07:28.880
your attitude has changed.

07:28.960 --> 07:30.640
I don't think it's just because
of the new officer, right?

07:35.480 --> 07:37.040
This is the army's arrow.

07:38.040 --> 07:40.760
Who have we crossed?

07:42.240 --> 07:44.080
This is more complex than it seems.

07:44.160 --> 07:47.160
Act accordingly, Ms. Ji.

07:53.520 --> 07:55.800
Yingying, what do we do now?

07:55.880 --> 07:57.760
We followed your words.

07:57.840 --> 08:00.240
We have thought of ways
to take orders from others

08:00.320 --> 08:02.640
to prevent Mrs. Hua
from driving us into destruction.

08:03.160 --> 08:05.920
If we can't wash our silks
and deliver the goods on time,

08:06.960 --> 08:08.880
we will lose a lot of money.

08:21.360 --> 08:24.880
I, Ji Yingying, a humble servant seeks
an audience with the new brocade officer!

08:24.960 --> 08:26.720
It concerns life and death!

08:26.800 --> 08:27.920
I humbly ask for permission!

08:32.039 --> 08:33.400
I, Ji Yingying, a humble servant…

08:33.480 --> 08:35.320
Seek an audience
with the new brocade officer!

08:35.400 --> 08:37.159
- It concerns life and death!
- It concerns life and death!

08:37.240 --> 08:38.760
We humbly ask for permission!

08:39.360 --> 08:41.120
It concerns life and death!

08:41.200 --> 08:43.960
Mr. Yang, while I am related
to the Wang family by marriage,

08:44.039 --> 08:45.680
our family is not involved in tax evasion.

08:45.760 --> 08:47.360
You can check our accounts.

08:50.160 --> 08:51.520
I'll speak…

08:51.600 --> 08:54.000
The Li family had a spot at Huanhua Creek

08:54.080 --> 08:56.160
as they persuaded others
with their influence.

08:59.640 --> 09:01.760
Mr. Wang from Jinxiu Court
will fart in front

09:01.840 --> 09:04.160
of the opposite store
on the first day of every month!

09:04.240 --> 09:06.600
Mr… Mr. Zhao Senior did not
wash his feet for eight years

09:06.680 --> 09:08.000
to be the Brocade Master!

09:09.240 --> 09:10.120
Alas!

09:11.440 --> 09:15.080
Seeking for an audience!
It concerns life and death!

09:15.160 --> 09:16.080
The people outside…?

09:16.680 --> 09:18.440
- No.
- Seeking for an audience!

09:18.520 --> 09:19.400
Alas.

09:19.480 --> 09:20.680
I have made up my mind not to see

09:20.760 --> 09:22.360
anyone in the days to come.

09:23.760 --> 09:25.680
- Appearing at the most crucial moment
- Seeking for an audience!

09:25.760 --> 09:27.200
- is how you leave a great impression.
- It concerns life and death!

09:27.280 --> 09:28.760
Change to a new batch.

09:28.840 --> 09:30.600
- Seeking for an audience!
- Seeking for an audience!

09:30.680 --> 09:33.040
It concerns life and death!

09:33.120 --> 09:35.320
That one with a beard.

09:35.960 --> 09:36.800
Yes.

09:36.880 --> 09:40.560
It concerns life and death!
I humbly ask for permission!

09:40.640 --> 09:41.800
Stop it.

09:44.600 --> 09:46.280
We have shouted for so long.

09:46.360 --> 09:47.520
He won't open the door.

09:47.600 --> 09:49.320
He does not want to see us.

09:51.200 --> 09:52.480
Do not fret.

09:53.160 --> 09:54.080
Since all the orders

09:54.160 --> 09:56.360
are from families
with large dyeing business,

09:56.440 --> 09:58.720
they must have places to wash silk.

09:58.800 --> 10:00.080
I'll discuss with them

10:00.160 --> 10:02.000
and see if they can lend
their place to us.

10:02.600 --> 10:03.840
Mrs. Hua didn't come.

10:07.000 --> 10:07.920
What do you mean?

10:12.920 --> 10:16.080
Who is against us most in this matter?

10:16.160 --> 10:17.000
Mrs. Hua.

10:17.600 --> 10:20.680
She has not sent a single servant
to inquire us as of today.

10:20.760 --> 10:21.680
What does that mean?

10:21.760 --> 10:22.680
What does it mean?

10:22.760 --> 10:23.720
Right. What does it mean?

10:24.360 --> 10:26.720
She already knows the outcome of today.

10:26.800 --> 10:29.400
She has probably cut off
all our means of survival.

10:30.480 --> 10:32.440
Is Mrs. Hua that impressive?

10:33.080 --> 10:35.840
She didn't dominate
Huanhua Creek for more than a decade

10:35.920 --> 10:37.920
by just being rude and overbearing.

10:38.760 --> 10:40.080
I have never underestimated her.

10:40.160 --> 10:42.440
Yingying! Bad news!

10:42.520 --> 10:43.480
BROCADE BUREAU

10:44.080 --> 10:45.560
Bad news! Your family is in trouble!

10:54.680 --> 10:57.240
You have served many brocade officers.

10:58.440 --> 11:00.320
I know you're more familiar
with the affairs

11:00.400 --> 11:01.480
of a brocade officer than me.

11:02.200 --> 11:03.920
I hope you will continue to guide me.

11:05.040 --> 11:08.960
We will give you our loyalty
and serve you with all our effort.

11:13.280 --> 11:15.120
I don't need your loyalty.

11:15.200 --> 11:18.440
However, if you dare to do
what I have forbidden,

11:19.440 --> 11:20.400
I can assure that

11:21.040 --> 11:24.080
you will disappear before I do.

11:24.160 --> 11:25.840
- Understand?
- Understand.

11:26.760 --> 11:28.200
I also do not wish anyone to know

11:28.280 --> 11:30.200
about my position
as the brocade officer yet.

11:30.280 --> 11:31.600
- Yes!
- Yes!

11:33.720 --> 11:35.000
As all of you know,

11:35.080 --> 11:38.520
I'm a timid person,
and I'm afraid of death.

11:39.320 --> 11:41.800
However, many
of the brocade officers have died.

11:42.720 --> 11:45.160
I believe all of you,
who have served for many years,

11:45.240 --> 11:48.760
know what the previous
brocade officers did.

11:48.840 --> 11:52.040
Please write all of them in great detail.

11:52.120 --> 11:54.920
I will consider it a guide, too.

11:56.040 --> 11:59.120
Mr. Yang, there is so much.
How can we write them all?

11:59.920 --> 12:00.960
- That's right.
- Yes.

12:02.000 --> 12:02.880
Write up there.

12:02.960 --> 12:04.160
No… I'll write here.

12:04.240 --> 12:05.880
- I'll write now.
- I'll write.

12:08.960 --> 12:10.440
- Give me a paper!
- Give me!

12:10.520 --> 12:12.640
We only have one loom!

12:12.720 --> 12:13.760
You can't take it!

12:13.840 --> 12:14.680
You can't!

12:14.760 --> 12:16.120
- Stop!
- Stop! You can't take it!

12:16.720 --> 12:17.560
Put it down!

12:17.640 --> 12:19.480
Paying debt is the right thing to do.

12:19.560 --> 12:22.680
Are you not aware of this, Ms. Ji?

12:23.520 --> 12:25.240
The note states clearly that the debt

12:25.320 --> 12:26.800
is to be settled within ten years.

12:26.880 --> 12:28.280
The time is not up yet.

12:28.360 --> 12:31.040
Why are you seizing our property?

12:31.120 --> 12:32.800
Settling it within ten years?

12:33.360 --> 12:35.600
That is your deal
with the previous debt collector.

12:35.680 --> 12:36.560
Not me.

12:36.640 --> 12:38.760
- The debt transfer means the debt…
- …remains unchanged.

12:38.840 --> 12:40.800
And the terms can't be modified.

12:40.880 --> 12:42.280
- That's right.
- That's right.

12:42.360 --> 12:43.840
The terms can't be modified?

12:44.840 --> 12:47.440
Which law states that?

12:51.000 --> 12:52.440
Go find

12:53.000 --> 12:56.040
any of your previous debt collectors
that will testify on your behalf.

12:56.120 --> 12:57.320
I'll wait for you here.

12:57.400 --> 13:00.400
Perhaps you have swayed those people
since you are so confident.

13:00.480 --> 13:01.360
- That's right.
- That's right.

13:01.440 --> 13:02.280
Alright.

13:03.560 --> 13:06.000
Let's not talk about the terms.
We'll talk about the debt.

13:06.880 --> 13:08.000
We never said we wouldn't pay,

13:08.080 --> 13:10.280
nor do we lack the ability to pay.

13:10.360 --> 13:13.080
Yet you barged into my home
and took my property to settle the debt.

13:13.160 --> 13:14.400
Is that ethical?

13:14.480 --> 13:16.680
We'll talk about the rules, then.

13:17.440 --> 13:20.520
This is a petition record regarding
past disputes at the creek.

13:20.600 --> 13:22.760
These are the annual accounting books

13:22.840 --> 13:24.880
submitted by several major dyehouses.

13:24.960 --> 13:27.560
They have a large production
with a variety of silk types.

13:28.360 --> 13:29.480
Is there a problem with that?

13:30.240 --> 13:32.440
In the past,
Brocade Master Ji Guinan dedicated

13:32.520 --> 13:35.040
many years to perfect
the dye of Shu Red Silk.

13:35.120 --> 13:36.800
No one could achieve it.

13:37.480 --> 13:40.640
The craft of Shu brocade
is not mastered overnight.

13:41.240 --> 13:44.320
A few major dyeing households,
such as the Hua family,

13:44.400 --> 13:46.080
have more than ten types
of signature silks now.

13:47.600 --> 13:50.040
Although they can't compare
to Shu Red Silk,

13:50.120 --> 13:51.720
they are still good enough.

13:51.800 --> 13:54.840
How did her family end up
dominating the industry?

13:55.640 --> 13:57.760
Also, the Hua family

13:57.840 --> 14:00.280
has always oppressed
smaller families to expand themselves.

14:01.240 --> 14:04.600
The Ji family incurred countless debts
due to Ji Guinan's crimes.

14:04.680 --> 14:07.640
The bond of debt
is now in Mrs. Hua's hands.

14:07.720 --> 14:09.400
It can be deduced that

14:09.480 --> 14:12.280
the Ji family is the next family
Mrs. Hua intends to seize.

14:13.520 --> 14:16.520
This may be why
Ms. Ji is so eager to retaliate.

14:17.960 --> 14:20.200
If we help her out in this matter,

14:20.920 --> 14:23.360
we might get closer to the Ji family.

14:26.120 --> 14:29.480
I do not deem you people
capable of paying the debt.

14:29.560 --> 14:33.800
Your dyehouses usually survive
on the leftover orders I give you.

14:33.880 --> 14:37.120
Now, I cannot be bothered
with such charity.

14:37.200 --> 14:39.760
Even if you take on
small orders here and there,

14:39.840 --> 14:41.360
you still have no place to wash the silk.

14:41.440 --> 14:45.160
Setting profits aside, if you cannot
complete the orders on time,

14:45.240 --> 14:46.920
you must pay double as compensation.

14:47.000 --> 14:49.200
If all your money
is used for compensation,

14:49.280 --> 14:50.520
you will not have
any left to pay the debt.

14:50.600 --> 14:52.480
So, I would rather
collect it from you now.

14:53.400 --> 14:54.400
Frankly,

14:55.280 --> 14:57.360
I am asking your family to offset the debt

14:57.440 --> 14:58.480
with your property right now.

14:59.160 --> 15:00.320
If that does not suffice,

15:00.400 --> 15:02.760
you must work for me to offset the debt

15:02.840 --> 15:04.400
- in the future.
- You…!

15:04.480 --> 15:05.960
Even if you want
our property to offset the debt,

15:06.040 --> 15:07.560
you should have informed us beforehand,

15:07.640 --> 15:09.040
and that applies only if we were late.

15:09.120 --> 15:10.000
Fine, then.

15:10.640 --> 15:14.600
We shall see if you manage to pay up
within this month, Ms. Ji.

15:15.360 --> 15:17.000
Before you do,

15:17.080 --> 15:19.840
I can charge interest
according to the contract,

15:20.560 --> 15:21.800
can I not?

15:23.760 --> 15:24.960
Can you afford that?

15:29.760 --> 15:30.920
Take their things.

15:31.640 --> 15:32.720
Stop!

15:32.800 --> 15:35.080
- Leave it alone!
- Put it down!

15:35.160 --> 15:37.080
- Put it back!
- Hands off!

15:38.120 --> 15:39.160
What are you doing?

15:39.240 --> 15:43.120
Are you making a scene
because you outnumber us?

15:43.960 --> 15:46.040
I am not like your old debtors,

15:46.120 --> 15:47.840
whom you can send away without a thought!

15:47.920 --> 15:49.680
I have the right to decide

15:49.760 --> 15:51.320
what to use to offset the debt.

15:53.080 --> 15:54.080
Gui,

15:54.720 --> 15:57.200
give Mrs. Hua all the raw silk
and dye from the dyehouse

15:57.280 --> 15:58.520
to offset the debt.

16:00.200 --> 16:01.720
Ms. Ji, if we gave them all the silk,

16:01.800 --> 16:02.920
what would we work with?

16:03.000 --> 16:03.960
If we fail to submit…

16:04.040 --> 16:05.880
That loom belongs to my brother.
We can't give it to them!

16:05.960 --> 16:07.560
There is nothing they cannot have.

16:12.680 --> 16:14.320
- Give it to them.
- Yaoting…

16:15.960 --> 16:18.880
I believe that one day,
we will be able to redeem it.

16:20.040 --> 16:21.360
Alright.

16:21.440 --> 16:24.280
I hereby accept
the interest for this month.

16:25.000 --> 16:27.360
When I come knocking next month,
I expect you

16:27.440 --> 16:30.040
to have gathered
the funds by then, Ms. Ji.

16:30.120 --> 16:31.280
If not,

16:31.360 --> 16:33.280
all of you will be working for me.

16:33.360 --> 16:35.040
Rest assured, Mrs. Hua.

16:35.120 --> 16:36.320
You will not have your way.

16:39.160 --> 16:40.960
Step aside! Shoo! Get off!

16:41.040 --> 16:42.040
- Go away!
- Hey!

16:42.120 --> 16:43.040
Go away!

16:44.080 --> 16:44.920
Take it away!

16:58.240 --> 16:59.400
Mother!

17:01.040 --> 17:03.120
I sent Mother
to our aunt's house this morning.

17:03.200 --> 17:04.839
She will be in Ba County for a while.

17:06.640 --> 17:08.880
You said it yourself.
If everything is fine, nothing happens.

17:08.960 --> 17:11.359
If something crops up,
send Mother out for a walk.

17:11.440 --> 17:14.040
You are opposing Mrs. Hua, so I know
something will arise for sure.

17:16.839 --> 17:19.880
I already expected her
to come knocking to collect the debt.

17:19.960 --> 17:21.960
I did not expect her
to take advantage of the situation

17:22.040 --> 17:23.680
to make us work for her!

17:26.160 --> 17:27.960
We still have things at home,

17:28.040 --> 17:30.320
which should be enough to offset the debt.

17:30.400 --> 17:31.240
We will not have to work for her.

17:31.320 --> 17:33.360
If we give them any more things,

17:33.440 --> 17:34.960
we will end up with nothing again.

17:35.040 --> 17:37.160
No. That must not happen.

17:39.800 --> 17:41.000
Pin, come with me.

17:43.600 --> 17:45.160
What is our mission here?

17:45.240 --> 17:46.080
Tell me again.

17:48.240 --> 17:51.360
Reproduce the Shu Red Silk,
get to the bottom of the murder,

17:51.440 --> 17:53.560
and reform the brocade industry
in Yizhou. So…

17:53.640 --> 17:55.400
The duck in San Hua Pavilion
should be ready now.

17:59.960 --> 18:01.520
Prepare the sedan chair.
We are going out the back door.

18:03.120 --> 18:04.160
It is the second watch of the Hai hour.

18:04.240 --> 18:07.080
Shut your doors and windows
in case of burglars.

18:13.840 --> 18:16.040
So? Do I look like someone
from the Sang family?

18:17.200 --> 18:18.080
Yes.

18:18.840 --> 18:20.160
You just look a little…

18:21.160 --> 18:22.000
A little what?

18:23.920 --> 18:24.760
A little…

18:25.320 --> 18:26.400
A little fun.

18:27.720 --> 18:28.720
Excellent.

18:33.920 --> 18:36.000
Have you never thought
of getting help from Mr. Zhao?

18:39.080 --> 18:42.800
I like him
because he understands and respects me.

18:42.880 --> 18:44.400
He makes me happy,

18:45.080 --> 18:46.440
but that is not because he can help me.

18:48.320 --> 18:49.520
When my father was alive,

18:49.600 --> 18:52.440
everyone was nice to me.

18:52.520 --> 18:54.120
However, when something
happened to my family,

18:54.200 --> 18:56.400
only a few of them helped us out.

18:56.480 --> 19:00.280
Hence, I learned that
it is fine to seek and accept help,

19:00.360 --> 19:02.520
but I cannot depend on others' help alone.

19:02.600 --> 19:05.240
Only I will never let myself down.

19:07.000 --> 19:09.000
However, Pin, you are certainly different.

19:09.080 --> 19:12.560
I am sure you will find
a dependable young man you like.

19:14.520 --> 19:16.600
How pleasant it must be
to be able to trust

19:16.680 --> 19:17.880
and rely on someone.

19:19.240 --> 19:21.880
Sadly, I probably
cannot experience that anymore.

19:21.960 --> 19:23.760
I only trust myself and my own hands.

19:34.960 --> 19:35.800
Come along.

19:35.880 --> 19:40.800
BROCADE BUREAU

19:42.080 --> 19:43.720
Wait for me here.

19:43.800 --> 19:44.640
Alright.

19:49.240 --> 19:50.440
What is it?

19:50.520 --> 19:52.840
Chief Sang forgot something at the bureau.

19:52.920 --> 19:54.560
He has asked me to retrieve it for him.

19:54.640 --> 19:56.400
What is it?

19:56.480 --> 19:58.120
We will deliver it to him.

19:59.400 --> 20:02.920
Since Chief Sang has sent me here
in the middle of the night,

20:03.000 --> 20:05.280
the item certainly
should not be known to outsiders.

20:06.040 --> 20:08.400
If you don't have a say on this,
perhaps you should

20:08.480 --> 20:11.360
report to the new brocade officer
for a decision on this matter.

20:11.440 --> 20:12.280
He is not around.

20:12.360 --> 20:14.400
Is that not even better?

20:14.480 --> 20:17.360
You two will be the ones
doing Chief Sang a favor.

20:17.960 --> 20:20.240
When I get back, I will tell Chief Sang

20:20.320 --> 20:22.320
that it was all thanks to your leniency.

20:24.920 --> 20:25.760
Are you out of your mind?

20:28.360 --> 20:29.880
Please return and tell Chief Sang

20:29.960 --> 20:31.840
that we would love to help,

20:31.920 --> 20:33.040
but the new officer has given orders.

20:33.120 --> 20:34.080
No one is allowed to enter.

20:34.160 --> 20:35.000
Try again tomorrow.

20:35.720 --> 20:36.680
Please!

20:36.760 --> 20:40.280
Chief Sang needs it urgently.
Please make an exception!

20:41.480 --> 20:42.360
Hello?

20:45.960 --> 20:47.200
Hey!

20:53.720 --> 20:56.280
I never expected to get in today, anyway.

20:58.560 --> 21:00.080
I was just testing the waters.

21:00.160 --> 21:01.760
It was not entirely fruitless, either.

21:03.760 --> 21:05.880
Those guards have always
been greedy and tend to avoid trouble.

21:05.960 --> 21:08.360
Just now, I tried to get
past them in Chief Sang's name,

21:08.440 --> 21:09.640
and I even gave them money,

21:09.720 --> 21:11.000
but it was useless.

21:11.080 --> 21:12.760
In other words, this new brocade officer

21:12.840 --> 21:14.760
either promised them huge rewards

21:14.840 --> 21:16.320
or terrible punishments.

21:17.160 --> 21:18.640
He is not to be trifled with.

21:18.720 --> 21:20.280
Isn't that bad?

21:24.520 --> 21:25.920
He may be a tricky one,

21:26.000 --> 21:29.240
but if he has something he wants,
we can negotiate a deal.

21:30.000 --> 21:31.080
However,

21:32.000 --> 21:33.840
will he dare to order
those great families around?

21:34.440 --> 21:37.280
With the right price,
we can still strike a deal.

21:39.400 --> 21:41.000
Let us wait at the back door. Come on.

21:41.600 --> 21:43.080
You should change your clothes first.

21:43.760 --> 21:45.160
Alright. I shall get changed.

21:47.640 --> 21:49.160
We will get him this time!

21:49.240 --> 21:51.240
The smoke will drive him out!

21:52.360 --> 21:53.480
Sang Shisi!

21:54.960 --> 21:55.880
- They are on our side.
- Jiang Liu?

21:58.560 --> 22:00.680
Ji Yingying, you gave me a fright!

22:01.280 --> 22:02.960
- You are here, too?
- What are you doing?

22:03.600 --> 22:04.480
As you have predicted,

22:04.560 --> 22:07.040
the other families refused to let us
wash silk at their place.

22:08.000 --> 22:09.360
I went to your house to inform you,
but you were not home.

22:10.200 --> 22:11.720
When I came out, I bumped into him.

22:11.800 --> 22:14.360
He said he knew a way
to get us to meet the brocade officer.

22:14.960 --> 22:16.720
I sneaked out to help you.

22:16.800 --> 22:18.240
Well? Nice of me, right?

22:18.840 --> 22:20.240
So, this is your idea?

22:21.440 --> 22:23.120
He refused to come out,
so I will smoke him out.

22:23.200 --> 22:24.400
Well? Smart, am I not?

22:24.480 --> 22:26.640
Listen here. This officer is a tricky one.

22:26.720 --> 22:27.840
Do not do anything rash. We should go.

22:27.920 --> 22:29.880
No matter how tricky he is,
what can he do?

22:29.960 --> 22:31.560
Beat me up?

22:31.640 --> 22:33.040
What if he tells your father about it?

22:33.120 --> 22:35.920
If he tells my father, then… Then…

22:36.000 --> 22:37.200
This really is not the way.

22:37.280 --> 22:38.320
Oh, no! Run!

22:38.400 --> 22:40.000
Put out the fire! The fire!

22:40.080 --> 22:41.320
Oh, yes! The fire!

22:41.400 --> 22:42.520
Put it out.

22:46.480 --> 22:48.480
- There!
- Who's there?

22:48.560 --> 22:50.320
How dare you start a fire
outside the Brocade Bureau?

22:54.680 --> 22:57.240
We did not start a fire.
We were putting it out.

22:57.320 --> 22:59.680
Yes, we just happened to pass by.

23:02.040 --> 23:03.800
Just passing by! Passing by…

23:05.400 --> 23:07.200
Is anyone hurt?

23:08.520 --> 23:10.840
Thank you for your concern, sir.
We are all in one piece.

23:12.280 --> 23:13.120
I am glad to hear that.

23:14.080 --> 23:14.960
You may leave now.

23:19.760 --> 23:20.680
Great.

23:21.320 --> 23:22.640
I told you it works!

23:23.640 --> 23:24.680
Does that mean

23:26.200 --> 23:28.440
you came here for me?

23:29.120 --> 23:30.320
No!

23:30.960 --> 23:32.520
He means to say that

23:32.600 --> 23:35.320
it was fortunate you were on patrol,
so you were not affected by the fire.

23:35.400 --> 23:36.240
That's right.

23:37.840 --> 23:39.360
Does that mean

23:39.440 --> 23:42.600
I should be thanking you?

23:43.320 --> 23:45.680
No… This is our duty.

23:46.480 --> 23:47.960
There is some fire
we have not put out yet!

23:51.720 --> 23:52.880
What is going on?

23:53.800 --> 23:57.000
Am I seeing things? Did that sedan chair
just swallow Yingying?

24:01.440 --> 24:02.920
Mr. Yang?

24:15.920 --> 24:17.720
You are the new brocade officer?

24:23.360 --> 24:24.920
What is the cost
of raw silk production this year?

24:25.000 --> 24:26.680
How many dyes are needed to create indigo?

24:26.760 --> 24:27.960
How much is a bolt…?

24:34.720 --> 24:35.640
Why did you stop?

24:36.640 --> 24:38.520
Not all brocade officers
know about brocades, right?

24:38.600 --> 24:40.040
They die quickly, after all.

24:43.280 --> 24:44.880
Mr. Yang, you are a noble man.

24:44.960 --> 24:46.440
I am sure you will live a good, long life.

24:46.520 --> 24:47.400
Go on.

24:49.800 --> 24:51.720
Are you not here to flatter me?

24:54.280 --> 24:56.040
Surely you jest, Mr. Yang.

24:56.120 --> 24:57.720
I was being sincere.

24:58.320 --> 25:00.440
After all, you are handsome and charming.

25:00.520 --> 25:02.080
You are keen, needlessly harsh,

25:02.160 --> 25:05.600
mean, have pockets lush,
but soon to be crushed.

25:05.680 --> 25:07.560
You did not mean that, did you, Ms. Ji?

25:08.560 --> 25:11.160
You have even started a fire
in front of my bureau.

25:11.960 --> 25:14.160
So, you are not here
just to flatter me, are you?

25:14.240 --> 25:17.800
I am sure you know very well
what I want, Mr. Yang.

25:20.760 --> 25:21.840
What do I get out of this?

25:22.800 --> 25:25.240
You are a brocade officer,
but you hide your real appearance.

25:25.320 --> 25:27.120
You must have your reasons.

25:28.120 --> 25:30.000
However, I am not good with secrets.

25:30.080 --> 25:32.880
Please forgive me if I let anything slip.

25:32.960 --> 25:34.640
Are you threatening me?

25:34.720 --> 25:36.600
Oh, I would not dare to. Farewell.

25:43.680 --> 25:46.040
Mr. Yang, do you want me
to scream right now?

25:46.120 --> 25:47.080
Go ahead, then.

25:48.040 --> 25:50.240
If something undesirable happens to me,

25:51.040 --> 25:53.440
I cannot do anything about Huanhua Creek.

25:54.480 --> 25:55.320
You…!

26:04.280 --> 26:07.160
If this drags on,
they will start suspecting.

26:08.360 --> 26:10.960
Those three out there
seem quite fond of burning things.

26:11.040 --> 26:13.000
Take them to the creek

26:13.080 --> 26:15.360
and tell them to burn up
that pile of branches.

26:15.440 --> 26:16.680
They are not allowed to leave before then.

26:16.760 --> 26:17.800
I…

26:18.720 --> 26:20.080
I meant the one inside.

26:29.120 --> 26:30.200
I did not drink soup today,

26:30.280 --> 26:31.960
so I would like to make some myself.

26:32.560 --> 26:35.000
Since you love playing with fire,

26:35.080 --> 26:36.480
shall I take you to the kitchen?

26:36.560 --> 26:40.120
You can boil water,
add firewood, and make soup for me.

26:40.720 --> 26:42.000
I will cut you in half!

26:42.080 --> 26:44.560
I will split you, you vile officer!

26:44.640 --> 26:47.320
- You! I will chop you up, vile officer!
- Who are you cursing?

26:49.320 --> 26:51.760
A vile officer. I was not cursing you.

26:51.840 --> 26:52.880
Are you a vile officer?

27:02.080 --> 27:03.440
Look at you.

27:04.040 --> 27:07.920
Look what a mess you made
of the Brocade Bureau.

27:08.480 --> 27:09.640
The Shu brocade industry
is in a mess, too.

27:09.720 --> 27:11.440
You did not seem to care, though.

27:11.520 --> 27:12.880
Greedy people always flock to places

27:13.600 --> 27:15.000
where money can be earned.

27:15.720 --> 27:17.400
When too many of them gather in one place,

27:17.480 --> 27:19.200
they are bound to make a mess.

27:19.280 --> 27:21.920
This is not something
you can settle overnight.

27:23.160 --> 27:25.640
You are rushing just to add firewood,

27:26.400 --> 27:28.400
so, of course,
you would make a mess of yourself.

27:28.480 --> 27:30.600
Mr. Yang, do you know
you are supposed to keep quiet

27:30.680 --> 27:31.800
if you have never lived
someone else's life?

27:32.680 --> 27:34.600
To get out of a sticky situation,

27:34.680 --> 27:36.400
do you add fuel to the fire,

27:36.480 --> 27:38.840
or do you focus
on the heart of the matter?

27:49.720 --> 27:51.840
Shu red outshines all reds.

27:57.680 --> 28:00.080
The Shu Red Silk
was buried along with my father.

28:02.160 --> 28:04.680
The empress has a garment
made of Shu Red Silk,

28:04.760 --> 28:06.040
but it was accidentally ruined.

28:06.120 --> 28:07.720
If Shu red is reproduced

28:07.800 --> 28:09.400
and the silk is made into a garment,

28:10.560 --> 28:14.720
perhaps any injustice will be granted
a chance to be made right.

28:19.520 --> 28:21.760
I do not know
what you are talking about, Mr. Yang.

28:23.040 --> 28:24.600
If you are asking about Shu red,

28:24.680 --> 28:26.480
our family can no longer
produce Shu Red Silk.

28:27.160 --> 28:28.240
Shu red…

28:31.680 --> 28:34.120
The Shu Red Silk may be missing,
but justice has to prevail.

28:38.560 --> 28:40.320
That sounds familiar.

28:40.400 --> 28:43.600
Do you know what
the previous brocade officer said to me?

28:44.400 --> 28:45.520
What did he say?

28:55.280 --> 28:56.120
I apologize.

28:57.240 --> 28:58.400
What did he say?

29:00.600 --> 29:03.960
He said that I should only focus
on my peaceful life

29:04.040 --> 29:05.920
and that the officers
will take care of justice.

29:08.240 --> 29:09.680
You should do your part, too.

29:10.280 --> 29:12.000
If you depend on him alone,
what can he do?

29:12.080 --> 29:14.480
You will have to pick up
where he left off, then.

29:15.400 --> 29:17.000
Mr. Yang, will you
not help me think of ways

29:17.080 --> 29:19.040
to resolve my current predicament?

29:21.440 --> 29:22.800
Ms. Ji, do you

29:23.320 --> 29:25.280
only care about gains
and losses at the moment?

29:29.280 --> 29:31.240
How do you start a fire
with that much firewood?

29:31.960 --> 29:33.440
Enough. Stop this.

29:35.840 --> 29:38.400
- You may go home now.
- Farewell.

29:44.520 --> 29:45.640
Take care, Ms. Ji.

30:05.960 --> 30:08.680
JI GUINAN, SHU RED

30:12.080 --> 30:13.040
- Father.
- Yes?

30:13.120 --> 30:16.400
Your name appeared on the Wall of Colors.

30:16.480 --> 30:18.560
In the future,
I want to create a new color

30:18.640 --> 30:20.080
and become a Brocade Master, too.

30:20.160 --> 30:23.320
Then, my name
will be right next to yours, Father.

30:23.400 --> 30:24.400
Great!

30:24.480 --> 30:26.360
This spot. This spot is reserved for you.

30:26.440 --> 30:28.280
- Yes!
- We will both be Brocade Masters!

30:45.080 --> 30:48.360
Yingying, let go! Father once said that

30:48.440 --> 30:49.880
while brocade comes first,
people are above it.

30:49.960 --> 30:51.800
- We can remake brocades if we lose them,
- Let go!

30:51.880 --> 30:53.960
but we can do nothing if we lose someone!

30:54.040 --> 30:54.880
Let go, I said!

31:09.360 --> 31:13.440
JI GUINAN, SHU RED

31:17.280 --> 31:18.240
Father,

31:19.480 --> 31:20.960
now is not the time yet.

31:22.840 --> 31:23.960
Please wait a little longer.

31:28.320 --> 31:31.960
BROCADE BUREAU

31:32.040 --> 31:33.840
YIZHOU BROCADE BUREAU

31:39.840 --> 31:42.120
Mr. Yang, Ms. Ji is here again.

31:45.240 --> 31:46.960
I do not want to see her for now.
Tell her to go home.

31:48.880 --> 31:51.800
She said she will not leave
until you see her.

31:51.880 --> 31:53.040
Also, many people

31:53.120 --> 31:54.520
have gathered around
the entrance of the bureau.

31:54.600 --> 31:56.160
She was sobbing and wailing.

31:56.720 --> 32:00.280
If outsiders spread rumors of this matter,

32:01.080 --> 32:02.120
you may be at a disadvantage.

32:04.040 --> 32:06.360
You said she was crying?

32:06.960 --> 32:08.120
Yes.

32:16.000 --> 32:16.840
Let her in, then.

32:18.680 --> 32:19.920
After considering the stakes,

32:20.000 --> 32:21.960
I took matters into my own hands
and brought her in.

32:23.160 --> 32:25.360
- You brought her in? Where is she?
- She is waiting at the entrance.

32:27.000 --> 32:27.880
Why did you not tell me that sooner?

32:27.960 --> 32:29.040
Come here and help me get dressed!

32:29.120 --> 32:30.000
Okay.

32:33.520 --> 32:34.840
Where are my shoes?

32:37.880 --> 32:38.920
Mr. Yang.

32:42.840 --> 32:43.920
I shall take my leave now.

32:54.320 --> 32:56.360
Greetings, Mr. Yang.

32:56.440 --> 32:57.920
What brings you here?

32:58.520 --> 33:00.760
I am here to apologize to you, Mr. Yang.

33:03.080 --> 33:04.080
What did you do?

33:17.600 --> 33:19.760
Did you think that crying
would soften my heart?

33:21.160 --> 33:22.920
I do not fall for such tricks!

33:23.800 --> 33:26.800
Huanhua Creek is where the people
of Sandaoyan wash their silk.

33:26.880 --> 33:30.040
In the past, the various families
would wash their silk accordingly

33:30.120 --> 33:31.160
and keep to themselves.

33:31.800 --> 33:33.920
But now, a great family
has taken over the place

33:34.000 --> 33:36.680
and forbidden us
from washing silk overnight.

33:36.760 --> 33:39.120
I do not know what to do.

33:39.200 --> 33:42.640
Please be the judge
of this matter, Mr. Yang.

33:43.640 --> 33:45.360
Even Chief Sang could not
do anything about this.

33:45.440 --> 33:47.320
Do you think I, a mere brocade officer,
can resolve this?

33:49.200 --> 33:50.680
Mr. Yang, you have achieved much
despite your young age.

33:50.760 --> 33:52.560
I am sure you are a brave man.

33:53.200 --> 33:54.360
Do you mean that

33:54.440 --> 33:57.160
Chief Sang is advanced in years
and afraid to offend those in power?

33:58.720 --> 34:00.280
You said it, not me.

34:02.440 --> 34:05.880
I can only see your courage
and no one else.

34:08.040 --> 34:09.400
That was music to my ears.

34:10.199 --> 34:11.040
We last met only recently,

34:11.120 --> 34:13.920
but your speaking skills
have vastly improved, Ms. Ji.

34:14.960 --> 34:17.400
By the way, it has been
quite hot these days.

34:17.480 --> 34:20.080
It would be nice if someone could fan me.

34:21.280 --> 34:22.320
Let me do it.

34:31.040 --> 34:33.159
Are you doing it properly?
I do not feel the wind.

34:37.719 --> 34:38.560
My head is getting too cold.

34:42.080 --> 34:43.600
My feet are getting cold.

34:45.920 --> 34:46.760
Why did you stop?

34:48.080 --> 34:49.159
Yang Jinglan!

35:00.920 --> 35:03.520
Mr. Yang, please bring me justice.

35:08.000 --> 35:09.280
Are you begging me?

35:13.040 --> 35:14.400
Do you think I would help you

35:15.800 --> 35:18.720
just because you begged me?

35:24.000 --> 35:26.480
That day, by the creek, you teased me,

35:26.560 --> 35:28.480
but you also subdued the frightened horse.

35:28.560 --> 35:30.200
At the entrance of my house,

35:30.280 --> 35:33.320
thanks to your cooperation,
we managed to send Sang Shisi away.

35:33.400 --> 35:35.840
Mr. Yang, even though you do not like me,

35:35.920 --> 35:37.200
you are a kind man.

35:38.160 --> 35:39.280
I will remain kneeling

35:39.360 --> 35:42.120
and wager that you will have mercy on me.

35:43.760 --> 35:45.160
Why did you not wager from the start?

35:49.560 --> 35:51.000
I pity my bones.

35:52.640 --> 35:53.840
Now, that is rare.

35:58.760 --> 36:00.760
You finally spoke a word of truth.

36:02.080 --> 36:04.800
However, you have misjudged my character.

36:05.480 --> 36:06.760
I do not have a heart.

36:07.360 --> 36:08.440
I only care about my gains.

36:11.160 --> 36:14.240
Do you know what
the previous brocade officer said to me?

36:14.840 --> 36:15.800
What did he say?

36:17.840 --> 36:19.080
True.

36:19.160 --> 36:21.080
So, other than offering sincerity,
I have a deal to propose.

36:22.240 --> 36:24.640
The previous brocade officer,
Mr. Shen, told me that

36:24.720 --> 36:27.480
if the next officer is a good person,

36:27.560 --> 36:30.400
I should tell them the words
he left behind.

36:33.160 --> 36:36.800
Ms. Ji, would you trade anything at all?

36:38.000 --> 36:40.680
I wanted to plead with our connection,
but you were not swayed.

36:46.080 --> 36:48.440
NOTICE: HUANHUA CREEK
IS NOW SHARED PROPERTY FOR WASHING SILK

36:48.520 --> 36:50.680
NO ONE MAY CLAIM IT AS THEIR OWN
OFFENDERS WILL BE SEVERELY PUNISHED

36:51.760 --> 36:53.760
You already had a plan!

36:55.000 --> 36:56.760
I apologize for misunderstanding you.

36:58.480 --> 37:01.400
Ms. Ji, you should put
more trust in the bureau.

37:01.480 --> 37:03.400
No matter my objectives,

37:03.480 --> 37:05.120
I am now an officer.

37:05.920 --> 37:08.720
So, of course,
I will do what is expected of me.

37:09.240 --> 37:10.480
NOTICE

37:10.560 --> 37:14.560
Huanhua Creek is now shared property

37:14.640 --> 37:16.480
for washing silk.

37:16.560 --> 37:18.040
No one may claim it as their own.

37:18.120 --> 37:20.200
Offenders will be severely punished!

37:20.280 --> 37:21.760
Great!

37:21.840 --> 37:23.600
- Good!
- Good!

37:25.800 --> 37:27.400
Mr. Yang, you have
spoken up for the people.

37:27.480 --> 37:30.360
The people of Yizhou will definitely
remember your kindness.

37:30.440 --> 37:32.000
However, you may not know this.

37:32.680 --> 37:35.120
The brocade families
of Yizhou are powerful.

37:35.200 --> 37:37.360
Every one of them is quite influential.

37:37.440 --> 37:40.800
You have only recently arrived,
so you may run into problems

37:40.880 --> 37:42.400
that hinder the enforcement of laws.

37:42.480 --> 37:45.120
I worry that your authority
may be challenged.

37:47.360 --> 37:49.240
Why did you not tell me
before the notice was put up?

37:49.320 --> 37:51.280
I only thought of it just now.

37:59.560 --> 38:01.200
The brocade officer is here!

38:10.280 --> 38:12.720
So, he is the brocade officer?

38:12.800 --> 38:13.920
No wonder.

38:15.560 --> 38:16.920
My name is Yang Jinglan.

38:17.000 --> 38:19.200
I am the newly appointed
brocade officer in Yizhou.

38:22.120 --> 38:24.080
What? Do you not believe me?

38:29.040 --> 38:32.920
I did not expect you to be
the new brocade officer, Mr. Yang.

38:36.760 --> 38:38.400
Mr. Hua, are you on an outing?

38:38.480 --> 38:40.000
Surely you jest, Mr. Yang.

38:40.080 --> 38:43.160
Come here!
Prepare another seat for Mr. Yang.

38:43.240 --> 38:44.240
No need.

38:44.960 --> 38:47.680
I clearly remember the notice I put up

38:47.760 --> 38:50.840
stating that other
than those washing silk,

38:50.920 --> 38:52.440
no one is to remain
on the banks of Huanhua Creek.

38:53.040 --> 38:54.080
What is this?

38:54.160 --> 38:55.280
Have I remembered wrongly?

38:55.360 --> 38:57.000
Or do you fancy yourself powerful enough

38:57.080 --> 38:59.720
that you need not heed my orders, Mr. Hua?

39:00.480 --> 39:02.520
Mr. Yang, that is not the case.

39:04.200 --> 39:07.920
I dare not even dream
of opposing the bureau.

39:09.280 --> 39:10.120
Here.

39:10.920 --> 39:12.040
Take a look.

39:12.600 --> 39:13.480
Am I…

39:13.560 --> 39:15.920
Am I not washing silk now?

39:16.000 --> 39:18.520
This may not be a lot of silk,

39:18.600 --> 39:20.320
but I did not disobey your laws.

39:22.920 --> 39:24.400
You were washing silk, indeed.

39:25.440 --> 39:26.640
But if you ask me,

39:27.800 --> 39:29.280
since you have gathered your men here,

39:30.080 --> 39:31.920
you must be waiting for me, right?

39:36.000 --> 39:38.080
Mr. Yang, you have not been here for long,

39:38.160 --> 39:41.080
so you must not know
a lot about matters in Yizhou.

39:42.000 --> 39:43.200
But please rest assured.

39:43.280 --> 39:46.600
Our family is known
for being kind in this.

39:46.680 --> 39:49.400
We can help you learn all
about Yizhou as soon as possible.

39:52.560 --> 39:53.920
"He can bark all he wants,

39:54.560 --> 39:55.680
but I shall remain calm.

39:56.320 --> 39:57.600
He can be stubborn all he wants,

39:58.280 --> 39:59.600
but I shall remain unaffected."

40:02.400 --> 40:03.840
Mr. Hua, you may not know this,

40:03.920 --> 40:06.720
but I have been impatient
since I was young.

40:06.800 --> 40:10.480
To curb that impatience,
my teacher taught me those words.

40:11.200 --> 40:13.080
He said that if I lose my patience,

40:13.760 --> 40:16.240
I am to recite those words.

40:17.440 --> 40:20.360
Mr. Yang, your teacher
must have been quite enlightened.

40:20.440 --> 40:21.920
There must be great wisdom in his words.

40:24.760 --> 40:25.760
I think so, too.

40:27.960 --> 40:30.680
However, do you know

40:30.760 --> 40:32.840
what the last sentence is?

40:39.200 --> 40:40.600
I am but an ignorant fool.

40:40.680 --> 40:43.480
Please enlighten me, Mr. Yang.

40:50.240 --> 40:52.240
"If he does not stop barking,

40:52.320 --> 40:53.680
I shall send him to hell."

41:00.000 --> 41:01.280
- Yes!
- Good one!

41:01.360 --> 41:03.400
- All hail Mr. Yang!
- Get him!

41:24.480 --> 41:26.760
- What a show!
- Everyone!

41:27.840 --> 41:30.400
This is my first time being an officer,

41:30.480 --> 41:32.560
so I do not know much about the position.

41:32.640 --> 41:35.200
Even so, I know
that orders must be followed

41:35.280 --> 41:36.680
and promises must be kept.

41:37.320 --> 41:38.480
From now on,

41:38.560 --> 41:41.600
I will not tolerate anyone going against
the rules I have established.

41:41.680 --> 41:44.320
If anyone disobeys the rules,

41:45.080 --> 41:48.320
we shall see if his arguments
can win against my fists.

41:48.400 --> 41:50.040
Is that clear?

41:50.120 --> 41:51.920
- Clear!
- Yes, sir! We'll do as you say, Mr. Yang!

41:52.960 --> 41:53.960
Mr. Yang,

41:55.000 --> 41:56.520
I heard it loud and clear as well.

41:57.520 --> 42:00.600
Can… Can I go up now? I am freezing.

42:00.680 --> 42:03.040
Mr. Hua, since
you like this place so much,

42:03.120 --> 42:04.280
I shall fulfill your wishes.

42:05.000 --> 42:06.920
Stay in the water until nightfall,

42:07.000 --> 42:08.320
not even two hours less.

42:12.600 --> 42:14.280
They are dirtying
the waters of Huanhua Creek.

42:15.800 --> 42:18.000
Ms. Ji, I have kept my promise to you.

42:18.720 --> 42:19.600
It is your turn now.

42:22.760 --> 42:24.960
Mr. Shen's words are all written here.

42:25.040 --> 42:26.600
Read it as you please, Mr. Yang.

42:26.680 --> 42:27.840
I shall be off now.

42:28.880 --> 42:29.920
Go!

42:50.960 --> 42:53.960
Be a good officer
who speaks up for the people.
